137
00:08:24.713 --> 00:08:25.713
But then...

138
00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.430
little by little.

139
00:08:29.009 --> 00:08:30.839
you start picking up the pieces

140
00:08:30.927 --> 00:08:34.717
and you start realizing
what you're making is a mirror.

141
00:08:35.306 --> 00:08:36.306
And...

142
00:08:36.683 --> 00:08:38.693
